@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Criar cliente
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Souza",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "email": "maria.souza@example.com",
  "document": "12345678900"
}

### Listar clientes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers?search=maria&active=true&page=0&size=10

### Criar profissional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos Pereira",
  "phone": "11888888888",
  "email": "carlos.pereira@example.com"
}

### Listar profissionais
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals?search=carlos&active=true&page=0&size=10

### Criar serviço
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Consulta inicial",
  "description": "Atendimento de avaliação",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "bufferMinutes": 15,
  "price": 150.00
}

### Listar serviços
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services?search=consulta&active=true&page=0&size=10
